        "official_en_sha256": "0361344da037224ff702db8f0dec26e52d11b8698a4155961d17123ca597aefa"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここは用も無く立ち入る場所でない。\r\nいまは他にすべきことがあるじゃろう。",
        "official_en": "’Tis not the place to wander aimlessly. We have other pressing matters to attend to, do we not?",
        "real_en": "This isn't somewhere you should enter without a reason. We have other things to do right now, don't we?"
      },
      "review": {
