        "official_en_sha256": "571533315797e22ffac1589bab02c1928749138464fc7dc6878573938d492ade"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ただ、まずは本の魔物を全部\r\n退治するのが先じゃな。",
        "official_en": "However, dispatching the book monsters takes precedence.",
        "real_en": "But first, we need to defeat all the book monsters."
