        "jp_sha256": "c6ba37eb7b7ba1721a6348572a3be553d7fdc7ae63b486ee91f9e6a73b37eb49",
        "official_en_sha256": "69633c51811fa3d789f902cd5ddeb8d7b33b1a9f357d8758630adb38a371ac4f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "もう外に出るのか？\r\nせっかくだし、ミシディアの様子を\r\nもう少し見て回ろうぜ。",
        "official_en": "Leaving already? C’mon, we should look around some more. Make the most of our time in Mysidia.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
