        "official_en_sha256": "a03f2d56f117fc2b050f72f3c1c19c1f83cbcf16bd287eec4970feee289189f2"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "常闇のヴェリアスの言う通り、\r\nヘスの援軍と鉢合わせるかもしれねぇ。\r\n戻るのはやめておこうぜ。",
        "official_en": "Like Umbra said, if we head back, we’re pretty much guaranteed to run into Hessian reinforcements. Better forget about it.",
        "real_en": "As Veritas of the Dark said, we might run into Hess reinforcements if we turn back. Better not risk it."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
