      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "常闇の話を聞く前に\r\n他の八盟傑の話も聞いておくか。",
        "official_en": "We should talk to the rest of the Sworn Eight before we hear what Umbra has to say.",
        "real_en": "We should talk to the rest of the Sworn Eight before we hear what Veritas of the Dark has to say."
